```{=html}
<div class="list jd-index">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<a class="jd-row" href="<%- item.path %>" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<div class="jd-row-head">
<% if (item.categories && item.categories.length) { %><span class="jd-row-section"><%= item.categories[0] %></span><% } %>
<span class="jd-row-title"><%= item.title %></span>
</div>
<span class="jd-row-desc"><%= item.description %></span>
</a>
<% } %>
</div>
```
